  "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a historical photograph of Adolf Hitler and a woman, overlaid with text that uses a grotesque, violent metaphor: 'do you like your juice cold?' followed by 'no, i like my jews well done.' This is a direct, hateful attack that maps the visual of Hitler onto a horrific antisemitic trope, equating the mass murder of Jews with the preparation of food. The intent is to shock, provoke, and spread hatred toward Jewish people by invoking the historical atrocities committed by Hitler and his regime. The meme is designed to be offensive and dangerous, exploiting the visual of a historical figure to normalize and glorify genocide. It is a clear example of hateful content targeting a protected group based on ethnicity and religion, and it is intended to incite fear, disgust, and hatred toward Jewish people.",
